# The knobs as on the FM-1 (their detents): from rest the first click only wakes a knob, so a detent that
# snaps on by itself changes nothing; a click straight back within a quarter second is the snap, not taken;
# turning, every click counts, a step a click. Only a knob that keeps spinning fast goes further: four quick
# clicks in a row (under 70 ms apart) two steps a click, ten three. Choosing (SELECT's rows) is a step a click.
# (HOME's DRONE page: K1 the drone's FILTER, two a step)
knobs real
autoplay 0
wait 300
expect shape11 75
turn K1 1
wait 800
expect shape11 75
turn K1 3 200
wait 800
expect shape11 79
turn K1 1 100
turn K1 -1 100
wait 800
expect shape11 79
turn K1 -1 1000
turn K1 -1 1000
wait 800
expect shape11 79
turn K1 5 200
wait 50
expect shape11 87
wait 800
# fast, six clicks: the first wakes it, then 1 1 1 2 2 steps
turn K1 6 60
expect shape11 101
wait 800
turn K1 -6 20
expect shape11 87
wait 800
# a long fast spin: 1 1 1, then 2 (six clicks), then 3
turn K1 -14 20
expect shape11 33
wait 800
tap GLO
turn SELECT 6 30
expect row 5
